<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59445" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουρ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείρω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>barber, hair-cutter</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				373c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philyll.
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMagd.</u>
				15.1
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κ. τὰς μαχαιρίδας λαβὼν ὑπὸ
				τῆς ὑπήνης κατακερεῖ—τὴν εἰσφοράν
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ προσδοκίαν</span> for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γένειον</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				278
			</span></i>; as a purveyor of gossip, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.177a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				509a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shearer</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουρεῖ τῷ κείραντι τὰς αἶγας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					176.54
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a bird, said to chirp with a sound <i>as of
			clipping</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
